---
title: Filspresso Next - AI/ML Pipeline Detailed Sequence Diagram
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as User Browser
    participant NextJS as Next.js Frontend<br/>(Port :3000)
    participant NestJS as NestJS Backend<br/>(Port :4000)
    participant ChatModule as Chat Module<br/>(sessions, messages)
    participant Kafelot as Kafelot Module<br/>(prompt quota)
    participant PythonAI as Python AI Service<br/>(Flask, Port :5000)
    participant Tanka as tanka.py<br/>Model orchestrator
    participant EmbeddingModel as MiniLM-L6-v2<br/>Embedding model
    participant LLM as Qwen3-0.6B / Gemma3-1B-it<br/>LLM generators
    participant VLModel as Qwen3-VL-2B<br/>Vision-language model
    participant PGVector as PostgreSQL pgvector<br/>(coffee_facts, 384-dim)
    participant RDKit as PostgreSQL RDKit<br/>(molecules table)

    Note over Browser,RDKit: TEXT CHAT FLOW

    Browser->>NextJS: User sends message<br/>POST /api/chat
    NextJS->>NestJS: POST /chat/messages<br/>{session_id, content}
    NestJS->>ChatModule: createMessage(session_id, content)
    ChatModule->>PGVector: INSERT chat_message<br/>(role='user', content, timestamp)

    NestJS->>Kafelot: checkPromptQuota(account_id)
    Kafelot->>PGVector: SELECT prompt_count FROM kafelot<br/>WHERE account_id = ? AND period = current
    alt Quota exceeded
        Kafelot-->>NestJS: 429 Quota exceeded
        NestJS-->>NextJS: 429 error
        NextJS-->>Browser: Show quota limit message
    else Quota available
        Kafelot-->>NestJS: 200 {remaining: N}
        Kafelot->>PGVector: UPDATE prompt_count + 1

        NestJS->>NestJS: Generate embedding for query<br/>(or call Python AI)
        NestJS->>PythonAI: POST /embed<br/>{text: user_message}
        PythonAI->>Tanka: natural_language mode
        Tanka->>EmbeddingModel: encode(user_message)
        EmbeddingModel-->>Tanka: 384-dim vector
        Tanka-->>PythonAI: {embedding: [...]}
        PythonAI-->>NestJS: 200 {embedding}

        NestJS->>PGVector: Vector similarity search<br/>SELECT * FROM coffee_facts<br/>ORDER BY embedding <=> query_embedding<br/>LIMIT 5
        PGVector-->>NestJS: Top 5 coffee facts<br/>(context chunks)

        NestJS->>PythonAI: POST /chat/generate<br/>{prompt, context, mode}
        PythonAI->>Tanka: natural_language mode
        Tanka->>LLM: Generate response<br/>(prompt + retrieved context)
        LLM-->>Tanka: Generated text response
        Tanka->>Tanka: Calculate tokens used,<br/>generation time
        Tanka-->>PythonAI: {response, tokens_used, time_ms}
        PythonAI-->>NestJS: 200 {response, metadata}

        NestJS->>ChatModule: saveAssistantMessage<br/>(session_id, response, tokens_used)
        ChatModule->>PGVector: INSERT chat_message<br/>(role='assistant', content,<br/>tokens_used, generation_time)

        NestJS-->>NextJS: 200 {response, metadata}
        NextJS-->>Browser: Display AI response
    end

    Note over Browser,RDKit: IMAGE-ASSISTED CHAT FLOW

    Browser->>NextJS: User uploads image + message<br/>POST /api/chat (multipart)
    NextJS->>NestJS: POST /chat/messages/image<br/>{session_id, content, image}
    NestJS->>ChatModule: saveUserMessageWithImage

    NestJS->>PythonAI: POST /chat/describe_image<br/>{image_base64}
    PythonAI->>Tanka: describe_image mode
    Tanka->>VLModel: Process image<br/>(Qwen3-VL-2B)
    VLModel-->>Tanka: Image description text
    Tanka-->>PythonAI: {description}
    PythonAI-->>NestJS: 200 {image_description}

    NestJS->>NestJS: Combine user message + image description<br/>as enhanced prompt

    Note over NestJS: Continue with text flow above<br/>(embedding → retrieval → generation)

    Note over Browser,RDKit: CHEMISTRY MODE FLOW

    Browser->>NextJS: User asks about molecule<br/>POST /api/molecule
    NextJS->>NestJS: POST /molecule/process<br/>{input: SMILES or image}
    NestJS->>PythonAI: POST /molecule/identify<br/>{input}

    alt SMILES input
        PythonAI->>Tanka: chemistry mode
        Tanka->>RDKit: Validate SMILES,<br/>generate mol object
        RDKit-->>Tanka: Mol object, properties
        Tanka->>Tanka: Calculate molecular<br/>properties (MW, logP, etc.)
        Tanka-->>PythonAI: {mol_data, properties}
    else Image input
        PythonAI->>Tanka: chemistry mode
        Tanka->>Tanka: MolScribe model<br/>(swin_base_char_aux_200k)
        Tanka->>Tanka: Predict SMILES from image
        Tanka->>RDKit: Validate predicted SMILES
        RDKit-->>Tanka: Mol object
        Tanka-->>PythonAI: {smiles, mol_data}
    end

    PythonAI-->>NestJS: 200 {molecule_data}
    NestJS->>RDKit: INSERT/UPDATE molecule<br/>(smiles, mol, properties)
    NestJS-->>NextJS: 200 {molecule_data}
    NextJS-->>Browser: Render MoleculeVisualizer<br/>(py3Dmol 3D view)

    Note over Browser,RDKit: CHAT SESSION MANAGEMENT

    Browser->>NextJS: GET /api/chat/sessions
    NextJS->>NestJS: GET /chat/sessions?account_id=...
    NestJS->>ChatModule: listSessions(account_id)
    ChatModule->>PGVector: SELECT * FROM chat_sessions<br/>WHERE account_id = ?<br/>ORDER BY updated_at DESC
    PGVector-->>ChatModule: Session list
    ChatModule-->>NestJS: 200 {sessions}
    NestJS-->>NextJS: 200
    NextJS-->>Browser: Display chat history

    Browser->>NextJS: POST /api/chat/save<br/>{session_id, messages}
    NextJS->>NestJS: POST /chat/save
    NestJS->>ChatModule: saveSession(session_id, messages)
    ChatModule->>PGVector: UPSERT chat_session<br/>(messages JSON, token_total)
    ChatModule-->>NestJS: 200
    NestJS-->>NextJS: 200
    NextJS-->>Browser: Save confirmation

    Note over Browser,RDKit: MODEL LOADING BEHAVIOR

    PythonAI->>Tanka: First request triggers load
    Tanka->>EmbeddingModel: Lazy load MiniLM-L6-v2<br/>(if not loaded)
    Tanka->>LLM: Lazy load Qwen3/Gemma3<br/>(if not loaded)
    Tanka->>VLModel: Lazy load Qwen3-VL-2B<br/>(if not loaded)
    Tanka->>Tanka: MolScribe model loaded<br/>(if chemistry endpoint called)


